    {
      "reason": "Clarify what candidate competition changes and identify controls that separate objective form from negative count and effective terminal weighting. Exact host baseline settings must still come from its supplied configuration.",
      "query": "Sequential recommendation BERT4Rec sampled softmax cross entropy versus BPR binary cross entropy multiple uniform negatives: how do negative count, loss reduction and logit temperature affect gradient magnitude and ranking, and what controlled ablations distinguish their effects?"
    },
