      "reason": "Investigate the temporal implications of excluding later training interactions and find an efficient, reproducible candidate sampler.",
      "query": "Sequential recommendation negative sampling excluding all user training positives versus prefix-only positives: future interaction information, false negative tradeoffs, and exact uniform sampling without replacement with per-user exclusion sets"
    },
