      "reason": "Strengthen evaluation interpretation without changing the pinned evaluator or adding unavailable labels.",
      "query": "Recommendation evaluation sampled HR@10 with 99 uniform negatives versus full catalog ranking: metric inconsistency, paired user bootstrap uncertainty, repeated validation checkpoint selection bias, and limitations of raw positive negative logit margins"
